<http://data.silknow.org/object/396b508c-95dd-3edb-bd3e-6f76a1437e48>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Natural tabby-woven cotton ground, printed with woodblocks in two shades fo brown and neutral red. Two vignettes, arranged in alternating bands. One shows three hunters and a woman gathered round a prostrate dog; other shows two boys and girl fishing. In inter-spaces, a lozenge network of flowering branches with birds and butterflies. Both selvedges present; pale blue thread in each. Cotton stained, browned and in places rotted; many holes and frayed edges."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/7ce5fabc-2286-3cbf-af1e-7a2ab592c3ca> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Natural tabby-woven cotton ground, printed with woodblocks in two shades fo brown and neutral red. Two vignettes, arranged in alternating bands. One shows three hunters and a woman gathered round a prostrate dog; other shows two boys and girl fishing. In inter-spaces, a lozenge network of flowering branches with birds and butterflies. Both selvedges present; pale blue thread in each. Cotton stained, browned and in places rotted; many holes and frayed edges."@en ;
